++
++## Files that change
++- `sample_pkg/calc.py` — add `mean(values: Sequence[float]) -> float`, a new function next
++  to `add`, `divide` and `percent`, raising `ValueError` on an empty `values` and otherwise
++  returning `divide(sum(values), len(values))`.
